From: DaffyDabz <daffydabz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:14:08 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 013/371] Ships: repair spots, ship skills and ramming,
 broadside timing

- Repair spots on small player ships (L1-L3 hulls, 4 spots), want-ship-repair-spots prc switch;
  only crew may use them, the spot frees when the user leaves or logs off.
- Repair ticks every 2 s, faster with more crew repairing; purchaseRepairAll charges gold.
- Ship skills: grantShipSkill / requestShipSkill (sender-checked), ramming with hull rammingPower,
  25% backlash, ram kills credit the quest manager.
- Broadside: flight time clamped 1-255, damage lands after the last ball's delay.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
